(7226173, 1116576, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Just when you think you know a good bit about the world something comes along and surprise you. Thanks for including the name of the animal - my first thought is that there is no way this exists to find out that it does! Lighting and detail are very good. It is the composition that suffers a little and could be better. You left me wanting to see this sheep close up. I think it would be better if the head and horns filled the frame. That way your audience and I could see all the wonderful details in the fur and horns close up. It is a good shot, but if you brought your audience closer with zoom or crop you would have a stellar shot.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Just when you think you know a good bit about the world something comes along and surprise you. Thanks for including the name of the animal - my first thought is that there is no way this exists to find out that it does! Lighting and detail are very good. It is the composition that suffers a little and could be better. You left me wanting to see this sheep close up. I think it would be better if the head and horns filled the frame. That way your audience and I could see all the wonderful details in the fur and horns close up. It is a good shot, but if you brought your audience closer with zoom or crop you would have a stellar shot.', '2014-06-09 11:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
