(7227399, 1116150, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>Like the idea and well presented in composition and detail. My only suggestion to improve the visual appeal of the photo is to make sure lighting is even (it is O.K. when creating mood like film noir). Here the light from the shades creates patterns on the floor and on the subject that take spotlight attention away from your main subject when it needs to remain focused on the subject and no where else.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  Like the idea and well presented in composition and detail. My only suggestion to improve the visual appeal of the photo is to make sure lighting is even (it is O.K. when creating mood like film noir). Here the light from the shades creates patterns on the floor and on the subject that take spotlight attention away from your main subject when it needs to remain focused on the subject and no where else.', '2014-06-11 19:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7227400, 1115994, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>A nice capture of a slice of life in the moment. Great eye to spot this. Two windows, but only one has signs of life - and the gent is not only taking a smoke break but surfing the net on his own little window:-)</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. A nice capture of a slice of life in the moment. Great eye to spot this. Two windows, but only one has signs of life - and the gent is not only taking a smoke break but surfing the net on his own little window:-)', '2014-06-11 19:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
