(7228035, 1116583, 16106, '<td valign="top">The pool of light on the grass steals a lot of interest, and seems as in focus as the rack. A narrower DOF would have helped in that regard, There are nice colors and textures in the watercraft, but they struggle against the background.</td>', 'The pool of light on the grass steals a lot of interest, and seems as in focus as the rack. A narrower DOF would have helped in that regard, There are nice colors and textures in the watercraft, but they struggle against the background.', '2014-06-12 16:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
