(7228972, 1116045, 67258, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - photographed and processed with skill, and with a delicate touch.</td>', 'Beautiful - photographed and processed with skill, and with a delicate touch.', '2014-06-15 03:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228973, 1116610, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but not so keen on the execution.  In particular, the shallow depth of field resulting in the oof petals bothers me here, in a way that it wouldn''t in many photos.  Perhaps you were going with the idea of a wallflower being a shy individual, but aesthetically, I still find the blur jarring.</td>', 'I like the idea, but not so keen on the execution.  In particular, the shallow depth of field resulting in the oof petals bothers me here, in a way that it wouldn''t in many photos.  Perhaps you were going with the idea of a wallflower being a shy individual, but aesthetically, I still find the blur jarring.', '2014-06-15 03:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228974, 1116391, 67258, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really meet the challenge description ''...that under normal circumstances would be symmetrical''. However, it is a well taken photo with a carefully crafted composition.  Mono was a good move.</td>', 'Doesn''t really meet the challenge description ''...that under normal circumstances would be symmetrical''. However, it is a well taken photo with a carefully crafted composition.  Mono was a good move.', '2014-06-15 03:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228975, 1116562, 67258, '<td valign="top">The symmetry of the dandelion has only been slightly broken by the missing seeds, the assymetry in the photo has been achieved in the main through composition.  None the less, a pleasing photo with a nice delicate touch.</td>', 'The symmetry of the dandelion has only been slightly broken by the missing seeds, the assymetry in the photo has been achieved in the main through composition.  None the less, a pleasing photo with a nice delicate touch.', '2014-06-15 03:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228976, 1116489, 67258, '<td valign="top">Aww, cute - I wish I had a photograhic record of my children at the same stage!  You have missed the focus - the cage is sharp, but the face less so  which is a real shame.  Too late for the challenge, but not for your family album - go back and reshoot; it''ll be worth it :)</td>', 'Aww, cute - I wish I had a photograhic record of my children at the same stage!  You have missed the focus - the cage is sharp, but the face less so  which is a real shame.  Too late for the challenge, but not for your family album - go back and reshoot; it''ll be worth it :)', '2014-06-15 03:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228977, 1116266, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely - I''m not usually a fan of this particular processing style, but it works well here.  The only thing I am not so keen on is the excess space to the top of the frame.</td>', 'Lovely - I''m not usually a fan of this particular processing style, but it works well here.  The only thing I am not so keen on is the excess space to the top of the frame.', '2014-06-15 03:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
