(7228979, 1116150, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very!  A good idea for the challenge, and for such a potentially dull subject (I actually love socks - knit my own) really interestingly taken.  Your attention to detail - the clownish splayed feet, the textured floor surface that is subtley pleasing, and that gorgeous light and shadows has all paid off.</td>', 'Very!  A good idea for the challenge, and for such a potentially dull subject (I actually love socks - knit my own) really interestingly taken.  Your attention to detail - the clownish splayed feet, the textured floor surface that is subtley pleasing, and that gorgeous light and shadows has all paid off.', '2014-06-15 03:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228980, 1116138, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very well taken photo.  Perspective is spot on, lending an air of menace.  Cracking image.</td>', 'Very well taken photo.  Perspective is spot on, lending an air of menace.  Cracking image.', '2014-06-15 03:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
