(7229048, 1116608, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Lighting and details are great on this composition. I almost missed the asymmetry because my attention was drawn to the expression on the model''s face and I followed her eyes to look at the strand of hair coming down her face. While that expression adds interest it also has the unintended effect of drawing the attention away from what is asymmetrical in the shot - the uneven hair. I think the idea is solid but just needed a little more visual clues to hit your audience over the head with the asymmetry. Since the center strand was meant as a way to split both sides of the face you could have had one side of the lips one color with the other side another. Different color eye shadow would have also been a possibility along with the lipstick but may be a bit too much.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Lighting and details are great on this composition. I almost missed the asymmetry because my attention was drawn to the expression on the model''s face and I followed her eyes to look at the strand of hair coming down her face. While that expression adds interest it also has the unintended effect of drawing the attention away from what is asymmetrical in the shot - the uneven hair. I think the idea is solid but just needed a little more visual clues to hit your audience over the head with the asymmetry. Since the center strand was meant as a way to split both sides of the face you could have had one side of the lips one color with the other side another. Different color eye shadow would have also been a possibility along with the lipstick but may be a bit too much.', '2014-06-15 15:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7229049, 1116299, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Lighting on this bell pepper is just fabulous putting the spotlight on all the curves and shape of this asymmetrical vegetable. The B&amp;W was a great choice because the play of light and shadow in the warped shape and curves of the pepper really pop visually. Nicely captured.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Lighting on this bell pepper is just fabulous putting the spotlight on all the curves and shape of this asymmetrical vegetable. The B&W was a great choice because the play of light and shadow in the warped shape and curves of the pepper really pop visually. Nicely captured.', '2014-06-15 15:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7229074, 1116600, 67258, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge - an intriguing portrait that I could imagine hanging in a gallery.<br/> <br/>Back again - this really is excellent.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge - an intriguing portrait that I could imagine hanging in a gallery. Back again - this really is excellent.', '2014-06-15 18:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7229112, 1116567, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Square crop keeps the eye focused on the main subject. Lighting and details are quite lovely. I like we can see the ''veins'' in the flower petals - giving rich detail but at the same time showing how dainty the flower is. The flower and it''s position is asymmetrical but I think it would be stronger if the top two right petals were removed as that it doesn''t quite look half gone. Other than that a well done shot.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Square crop keeps the eye focused on the main subject. Lighting and details are quite lovely. I like we can see the ''veins'' in the flower petals - giving rich detail but at the same time showing how dainty the flower is. The flower and it''s position is asymmetrical but I think it would be stronger if the top two right petals were removed as that it doesn''t quite look half gone. Other than that a well done shot.', '2014-06-15 21:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
